  "title": "LFT Prices $664M Commercial Real Estate CLO",
  "summary": "NEW YORK, November 21, 2025 /PRNewswire/ — Lument Finance Trust, Inc. (NYSE: LFT) (“we,”; “LFT” or “the Company”) today announced the pricing of LMNT 2025-FL3, a $663.8 million managed Commercial Real Estate Collateralized Loan Obligation (“CRE-CLO”). The Company expects approximately $585.0 million of investment grade securities to be placed with institutional investors, providing LFT with term financing on a non-mark-to-market,",
